@startuml 개인성격분석_요청

autonumber

actor User as U
participant FlutterApp as F
participant "SajuController\n(Flask API)" as SCT
participant "SajuCalculator" as SC
participant "PersonalityAnalyzer" as PA
participant "CharacterSystem" as CS
participant "DataValidator" as DV

U -> F: 개인 성격 분석 버튼
F -> SCT: POST /saju/traits {saju, gender}
SCT -> SCT: load_json(SajuTraitsSchema)
SCT -> SC: analyze_personality(saju, gender)
SC -> DV: validate_saju_data(saju)
DV --> SC: ok
SC -> SC: calculate_personal_traits(saju)
SC -> PA: analyze_five_elements(saju)
PA --> SC: {wood, fire, earth, metal, water}
SC -> PA: calculate_8_traits(saju)
PA --> SC: {passion, intuition, mood_swing, courage, responsibility, conflict, charisma, independence}
SC -> PA: generate_personality_report(traits)
PA --> SC: report string
SC -> SC: calculate_personality_flags_hd2(saju, gender)
SC --> SC: {flags, sal}
SC -> CS: determine(five_elements_scores)
CS --> SC: character_type (wood/fire/earth/metal/water)
SC --> SCT: {five, traits, flags, report, character}
SCT -> SCT: result["character"] = character_type
SCT -> SCT: result["saju"] = saju
SCT --> F: 200 {five, traits, flags, report, character, saju}
F --> U: 결과 화면 표시

alt 검증 실패
  DV --> SC: ValidationError
  SC --> SCT: ValidationError
  SCT --> F: 400 잘못된 입력(날짜/필드 누락)
  F --> U: 수정 안내
end

@enduml

